      "description": "Watch Academico Viseu vs Santa Clara highlights and goals from Primeira Liga on ReFooty: Football Highlights Hub. Match played on August 15, 2026. The Primeira Liga delivered a tactical and high-stakes encounter on August 15, 2026 , as Academico Viseu played host to Santa Clara . Both sides took to the pitch with clear ambitions of establishing dominance, setting the stage for a match defined by narrow margins and clinical execution. Paciencia Strikes from the Spot Santa Clara signaled their intent early on, nearly producing a goal of the season contender in the 10th minute. Goncalo Paciencia connected with a stunning bicycle kick that seemed destined for the net, only for Ewerton to produce a brilliant save. However, the pressure told just moments later. In the 12th minute, Ruben Pereira tripped Sorriso inside the penalty area, prompting the referee to point to the spot and issue a yellow card to the Academico Viseu defender. After a brief VAR review confirmed the initial decision, Goncalo Paciencia stepped up in the 14th minute. The striker remained composed, firing a right-footed shot past Ewerton , who came close to a save but couldn't keep it out. The remainder of the first half was a physical affair, highlighted by a yellow card for Sorriso for a shirt-pull, as Santa Clara took their lead into the interval. Tactical Shifts and Penalty Drama Academico Viseu emerged for the second half with renewed vigor, eventually controlling 60% of the ball. Despite their territorial dominance, they struggled to create clear-cut openings against a disciplined Santa Clara defense. Both managers turned to their benches to find a spark; Pedro Barcelos and Nikolaos Michelis were introduced for the hosts, while the visitors looked to consolidate their position with fresh legs. The game's most controversial moment arrived in the 82nd minute. Guilherme Romao went down in the box, sparking appeals for a penalty that could have changed the match. However, the referee ruled that the player had dived, brandishing a yellow card instead and leaving the home fans incensed. A Frantic Finish As the match entered stoppage time, Academico Viseu threw everything forward. In the 95th minute, Robinho delivered a pinpoint cross that found Joao Guilherme , but the resulting header flashed wide of the post. Santa Clara 's backline, anchored by late clearances from Hiago Santos and vital interceptions by Lucas Franca , held firm under intense pressure to secure the three points as the final whistle blew."
